  I misled you.  Quest Nemeses respond you seeing you, for the 
most part.  (Invisibility can frequently let you get right up 
to them.)

  The level's no-teleport, which can make things awkward.

  Amulet of life saving, scroll of instant boulder fort,
and wand of death with plenty of available charges should
still work, once you wake AT.

  Judging by the Gazetteer at:

<http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/gazetteer/quest/sam.html#goal>


  You should be able to set up a boulder fort lined up with a 
door and AT.  Then you can break down the door with a wand
of digging/fire/cold/etc.  (Not striking.  Striking would break
one of your boulders.)  

  Then attacking AT with an offensive wand would surely wake
him.  (And if it doesn't wake him, what do you care?  Kill him
dishonorably from a distance.)  Once he's awake, use your
wand of death for a sure kill.  That way he won't teleport
away to heal or, worse yet, escape up the stairs.



